================================================================================
1. BUNDLED NUCLEAR, ATOMIC & MATERIAL REFERENCE DATASETS (Panex/Data/)
================================================================================

- LLNL EPDL / EPICS2025 (Panex/Data/PA_EPDL_2025/)
  Evaluated Photon Data Library (epdl_2025_xs.csv,
  epdl_2025_absorption_edges.csv).

- NIST XCOM (Panex/Data/PA_NIST_XCOM/)
  Photon Cross Sections Database, Version 3.1 (MDATX3.001-MDATX3.100,
  ATWTS.DAT, ENB.DAT, HASH1.DAT, HASH2.DAT, INDEX.DAT).
  M. J. Berger and J. H. Hubbell, National Bureau of Standards / NIST Report
  NBSIR-87. Subject to NIST and original author terms and disclaimers.

- JENDL-5 Photonuclear Data (Panex/Data/PN_JENDL5/)
  Japanese Evaluated Nuclear Data Library, JENDL-5 photonuclear total
  photoabsorption cross sections (pn_jendl5_xs.csv; 286 nuclides, MT=3 with
  MT=5 fallback), Japan Atomic Energy Agency (JAEA).

- ANSI/ANS-6.4.3 Buildup Factor Parameters (Panex/Data/ANSI_EBF.csv, ANSI_EABF.csv)
  Geometric Progression (G-P) fitting parameters for exposure buildup factors
  (EBF) and energy absorption buildup factors (EABF) per ANSI/ANS-6.4.3.

- NIST ESTAR Material Library (Panex/Data/Material_NIST-ESTAR.json)
  NIST Standard Reference Database 124.
  https://dx.doi.org/10.18434/T4NC7P

- PNNL Compendium of Material Composition Data (Panex/Data/Material_PNNL-15870-Rev2.json)
  Detwiler, Rebecca S., et al. "Compendium of Material Composition Data for
  Radiation Transport Modeling." PNNL-15870 Rev. 2, April 2021.
  https://doi.org/10.2172/1782721

- Elemental & Isotopic Reference Tables (Panex/Data/Elements.csv, Isotopes.csv)
  Standard elemental atomic weights and natural isotopic abundances/masses.

